    "convolver_host_adapter": "Accepted 256- and 1024-frame conditions are powers of two. The source takes a direct same-callback Zita processing path; its non-power-of-two input/output FIFO adapter is not used. This is source inspection, not measurement of the external Zita implementation or hardware scheduling.",
    "zita_configuration": "Stereo input/output, 4096-sample kernel, fragment and minimum partition equal actual callback blocksize, maximum partition Convproc::MAXPART, density 0.5; process(true) runs within callback.",
    "limiter": "Both accepted presets retain enabled -1 dB limiter, 1 ms configured lookahead, oversampling None. Native wrapper reads LSP out_latency sample port; no fresh actual LSP latency-port value was measured. Do not label configured lookahead as measured whole-chain latency.",
